{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-connection-su2","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Example","doco:Section"],"label":"ex:connection-su2","kind":"example","title":"Connection and curvature on $\\mathcal{O}(\\mathrm{SU}(2))$","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-connection","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-fiber-adjoint-su2"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-connection","cites":["references/woronowicz1987-twisted-su2"],"tags":["su2","connection"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Examples.su2Connection","text":"connection-su2.md","leanSource":"connection-su2.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"ex:connection-su2\"></a><p>On <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A = \\mathcal{O}(\\mathrm{SU}(2))</code> with its left-invariant calculus <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Omega^1(A) = \\mathrm{span}\\{\\omega_1, \\omega_2, \\omega_3\\}</code>, a connection is a covariant derivative <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nabla f = df + \\mathcal{A} \\cdot f</code>, where <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{A} \\in \\Omega^1(A)</code> is the connection 1-form. It satisfies the Leibniz rule <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nabla(fg) = (\\nabla f)g + f(dg)</code>. The curvature <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">F_\\nabla = d\\mathcal{A} + \\mathcal{A} \\wedge \\mathcal{A} \\in \\Omega^2(A)</code> is strictly <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code>-linear.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/connection-su2.md","heading":"Example","number":"4.6.6","page":"b/ex-connection-su2","qa":{"counts":{"pass":65,"fail":0,"warn":2,"na":7,"unknown":0,"stale":58},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":1}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Examples.su2Connection","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/connection-su2.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
